  "transcript": "And under it, Thursday's twelve lanes, with their hours. Halden license against the twenty-fourth at nine. Old four at ten. The rope walks first four against the twenty-first at half-past ten. In the graving, before the whole town. And halfway down. Two o'clock. Team seven, Meridian nine. Against the tarn, second four sixteen. The tarn, said Perrin."
